    <forecast>
        <area aac="SA_FA001" description="South Australia" type="region">
            <forecast-period start-time-local="2026-09-22T21:17:44+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-22T21:17:44+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-22T11:47:44Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-22T11:47:44Z">
                <text type="warning_summary_footer">For latest warnings go to www.bom.gov.au, subscribe to RSS feeds, call 1300 659 210* or listen for warnings on relevant TV and radio broadcasts.</text>
                <text type="synoptic_situation">A high pressure system centred over the Tasman Sea extends a ridge over SA ahead of a low pressure trough that is expected to move over the far west of SA during Wednesday. The trough will slip southeastwards over southern coasts during Thursday and Friday, before being confined to the west over the weekend.</text>
                <text type="product_footer">* Calls to 1300 numbers cost around 27.5c incl. GST, higher from mobiles or public phones.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
        <area aac="SA_PW010" description="West Coast" type="public-district" parent-aac="SA_FA001">
            <forecast-period index="0" start-time-local="2026-09-22T21:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-23T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-22T11:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-22T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Clear. Winds easterly 15 to 20 km/h.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="1" start-time-local="2026-09-23T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-24T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-22T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-23T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers west of Nullarbor, most likely in the late afternoon and evening. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. Winds east to northeasterly 15 to 20 km/h tending north to northeasterly 20 to 30 km/h in the early morning then tending northeast to southeasterly 15 to 20 km/h in the evening. Overnight temperatures falling to between 8 and 14 with daytime temperatures reaching 28 to 34.</text>
                <text type="uv_alert">Sun protection 9:20am to 3:30pm, UV Index predicted to reach 7 [High]</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="2" start-time-local="2026-09-24T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-25T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-23T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-24T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers west of Nullarbor, most likely in the early morning. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm west of Nullarbor in the late afternoon and evening. Winds northwest to northeasterly 25 to 35 km/h tending northwest to southwesterly in the middle of the day then tending southeast to southwesterly 15 to 25 km/h in the late afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to around 15 with daytime temperatures reaching 25 to 33.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="3" start-time-local="2026-09-25T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-26T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-24T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-25T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower, most likely in the morning. The chance of a thunderstorm west of Nullarbor in the evening. Winds south to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h. Overnight temperatures falling to around 13 with daytime temperatures reaching 25 to 33.</text>
            </forecast-period>
            <forecast-period index="4" start-time-local="2026-09-26T00:00:00+09:30" end-time-local="2026-09-27T00:00:00+09:30" start-time-utc="2026-09-25T14:30:00Z" end-time-utc="2026-09-26T14:30:00Z">
                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Medium chance of showers west of Nullarbor, near zero chance elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm west of Nullarbor in the afternoon and evening. Winds east to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending north to northeasterly during the morning then tending east to southeasterly during the afternoon. Overnight temperatures falling to around 13 with daytime temperatures reaching 25 to 32.</text>
            </forecast-period>
        </area>
